+**D-7 — content:** three dev.to/HN-post drafts:
+1. "I built a local LLM gateway that keeps keys out of .env (C#/.NET 8, OSS)"
+2. "Designing an encrypted vault over BouncyCastle: Argon2id + XChaCha20"
